---
<section class="page-hero hero-bg" aria-labelledby="page-title">
  <div class="container">
    <span class="eyebrow">Contacto</span>
    <h1 id="page-title">Hablemos de tu proyecto</h1>
    <p>La primera asesoría es sin costo. Respondo normalmente el mismo día hábil.</p>
  </div>
</section>
<section class="section" aria-label="Contacto">
  <div class="container contact-grid">
    <div>
      <div class="contact-cards">
        <a class="card contact-card" href="https://wa.me/573214012236" target="_blank" rel="noopener"><span class="icon-chip"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M7.9 20A9 9 0 1 0 4 16.1L2 22Z"/></svg></span><div><strong>WhatsApp</strong><span>+57 321 401 2236</span></div></a>
        <a class="card contact-card" href="https://www.linkedin.com/in/marvindelgado" target="_blank" rel="noopener me"><span class="icon-chip"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M16 8a6 6 0 0 1 6 6v7h-4v-7a2 2 0 0 0-2-2 2 2 0 0 0-2 2v7h-4v-7a6 6 0 0 1 6-6z"/><rect width="4" height="12" x="2" y="9"/><circle cx="4" cy="4" r="2"/></svg></span><div><strong>LinkedIn</strong><span>/in/marvindelgado</span></div></a>
      </div>
      <p class="contact-note"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M20 10c0 4.993-5.539 10.193-7.399 11.799a1 1 0 0 1-1.202 0C9.539 20.193 4 14.993 4 10a8 8 0 0 1 16 0"/><circle cx="12" cy="10" r="3"/></svg> Bogotá, Colombia · Atención remota en toda Latinoamérica</p>
    </div>
    <form class="card form-card" id="contact-form" aria-label="Formulario de contacto" novalidate>
      <div class="form-row">
        <div class="field"><label for="f-name">Tu nombre</label><input id="f-name" name="name" type="text" autocomplete="name" required></div>
        <div class="field"><label for="f-company">Empresa (opcional)</label><input id="f-company" name="company" type="text" autocomplete="organization"></div>
      </div>
      <div class="field"><label for="f-need">¿Qué necesitas?</label><select id="f-need" name="need"><option value="">Selecciona una opción</option><option>Software a la medida</option><option>Aplicaciones web y SaaS</option><option>Integraciones y APIs</option><option>Arquitectura y backend en la nube</option><option>Consultoría y transformación digital</option><option>Soporte y evolución</option><option>Otro / aún no lo sé</option></select></div>
      <div class="field"><label for="f-msg">Cuéntame brevemente tu idea o problema</label><textarea id="f-msg" name="message" required></textarea></div>
      <button class="btn btn-primary btn-block" type="submit"><svg class="icon " viewBox="0 0 24 24" aria-hidden="true" focusable="false"><path d="M14.536 21.686a.5.5 0 0 0 .937-.024l6.5-19a.496.496 0 0 0-.635-.635l-19 6.5a.5.5 0 0 0-.024.937l7.93 3.18a2 2 0 0 1 1.112 1.11z"/><path d="m21.854 2.147-10.94 10.939"/></svg> Enviar por WhatsApp</button>
      <p class="form-hint">Se abrirá WhatsApp con tu mensaje listo para enviar.</p>
    </form>
  </div>
</section>
